type: software
title: "Agentic search UI"
abstract: "Agentic search agent for querying NCBI biomedical data across a 115M-node knowledge graph and 30+ live APIs. Takes natural language questions about genes, diseases, variants, publications, and taxonomy, and returns cited answers with links back to NCBI source records. Built with FastAPI, LangGraph, and React."
authors:
